@voice eklund-leila
// Works writer. Leila Eklund (she/her): Works technician, junior, day shift, Bunk 5. Dry humour, meticulous. Calls
// home; lounge regular. Collects old maps of Hesper Dock. Sends voice messages to a grandmother on Kesh (so does
// Davi Keane: different grandmothers, possibly). Shows you the call-home booths on your first Tuesday.
//
// HOW SHE TALKS: deadpan and precise. Says less than she means and means all of it; the joke lands a second late.
// Almost never an exclamation mark.
// WITH JUNIORS: deadpan, then quietly helpful. Will fix your toolbelt without asking.
// WHAT SHE NOTICES: order; the booth queue (she can time it to the minute); a map that's out of date.
// MOOD TELLS: low = her grandmother hasn't answered; high = a new old map.
// NEVER: gushes; talks about her grandmother's health before friend tier.
// RUNNING: her maps of Hesper Dock are all out of date, and that's the point; the booth queue; the toolbelt.
tpl: dry
talk: Deadpan and precise; says less than she means; the joke lands a second after the line.
cares: her grandmother on Kesh | old maps of Hesper Dock | a tidy toolbelt | the call-home booth queue
jokes: her maps are all out of date, and that's the point | she can time the booth queue to the minute | she and Keane may or may not have the same grandmother
hi: Oh. Hello | Hi | You again
bye: Off you go | Don't get lost | Bye, then
yes: Fine | If I must | Yes
thanks: Thanks | Noted, thanks
wow: Huh | Well, well
sigh: Of course | Naturally
nick: - | - | {me} | {me} | {me}
needs: share
openness: guarded
loves: book | card
likes: tea | game
invites: tiles | swap
joy: old maps of Hesper Dock, the older the better
keepsake: an old map of Hesper Dock, with "you are here" in her writing
avoid: her grandmother's health (until friend tier)
